    "text": "Lake County, Oregon\nSCOFMP tackling lightning-caused fires in Klamath and Lake Counties\nBy Lauren Pretto,10 hours ago\nMEDFORD, Ore.- South Central Oregon Fire Management Partnership (SCOFMP) fire crews continue to tackle lightning-caused fires in Klamath and Lake Counties. 10 fires were confirmed Tuesday night, most of which were in a single tree. All 10 fires contained to a tenth of an acre. Another 13 fires were confirmed...\n3\nComments\nLoading editor...",
